Description:  CSQTT 2.5.3 client core with everything needed to run it on OpenWrt:
 /usr/bin/csqtt-2.5.3 (musl transport; static on aarch64/x86/armv7, on
 mipsel dynamically linked against the target musl libc and libgcc1) plus the
 supervisor/CLI binary,
 service script, UCI template and activation helper in
 /usr/lib/csqtt/core-2.5.3/. Built with the documented OpenWrt patches:
 secrets via environment only, reliable SIGTERM handling, TUN handoff events
 over the supervisor socket, and terminal VK flood control keyed on the
 structured error code 9 (the flood event also names the VK method and attempt
 number, without URLs, parameters or tokens). Installing this single file is
 enough for a router; the LuCI panel is optional and packaged separately.
 License and required notices are installed under
 /usr/share/licenses/csqtt-core-2.5.3/ (PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0).
